<title>INDONESIA: TABLE - KOMATSU INDONESIA FIRST HALF NET UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - KOMATSU INDONESIA FIRST HALF NET UP.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		  (in billion rupiah except per share numbers)</p>
<p>    Net profit			25.41	  vs    20.98</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)	107	  vs	88</p>
<p>    Net sales		     300.57	   vs   242.72</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     38.29	   vs    33.22</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 36.93	   vs    30.67</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	    73.95	   vs    41.92</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were unaudited. PT Komatsu Indonesia is a heavy equipment manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
